  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "research-edit-24",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "research-edit-24-text",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why the checks are in the server"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "research-edit-25",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "research-edit-25-text",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In the May 2026 trials, models sometimes retried a dry-run operation as a live call or tried to assemble a forbidden action from allowed tools. Those observations motivated explicit checks in the operations server rather than relying on tool descriptions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "research-edit-26",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "research-edit-26-text",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "I implemented the servers and a TLS controller fixture for tests. The current operations server uses python-libjuju."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "research-edit-27",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "research-edit-27-text",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Evaluation limits"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "research-edit-28",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "research-edit-28-text",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The May trials mixed fixture and live-cluster runs, used one attempt per prompt, and predate the current backend. They explain the design but do not validate this implementation. A final model response was not a correctness score."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "research-edit-29",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "research-edit-29-text",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The policy permits some bounded scaling actions. HTTP transport needs authentication before use beyond localhost. Tests check enforcement behavior; operational decisions still need review."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
